!
! This test does a 4 index using schene 6 and calls RELCCSD with only MP2 to check correctness
! The test is primarily made to time scheme 4 vs. scheme 6 on parallel machines.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Generic closed shell molecule. Restricted kinetic balance.
.WAVE FUNCTION
**HAMILTONIAN
.LVCORR
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.EVCCNV
1.0E-6
**MOLTRA
.SCHEME
6
.THROUT
1.E-12
*END OF

 &RELCCSD TIMING=T, INTERFACE='DIRAC6',
          DOSORT=T, DOENER=T, DOFOPR=F, DOSOPR=F &END
 &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=F, DOCCSDT=F &END

